From: Humberto Piaia <betopiaia@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] juceaide: clear the target pkg-config sysroot for host tools

Buildroot's toolchain exports PKG_CONFIG_SYSROOT_DIR for target lookups.
JUCE resets other cross-build variables before bootstrapping native
juceaide, but leaves this variable in place. Host pkg-config then returns
ARM target include paths to the native compiler.

Clear it beside the existing pkg-config environment resets. Application
compilation continues to use Buildroot's target toolchain and dependencies.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Humberto Piaia <betopiaia@gmail.com>
---
--- a/extras/Build/juceaide/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/extras/Build/juceaide/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -90,6 +90,7 @@
         unset(ENV{OBJCOPY})
         unset(ENV{OBJDUMP})
         unset(ENV{PKG_CONFIG_LIBDIR})
+        unset(ENV{PKG_CONFIG_SYSROOT_DIR})
         unset(ENV{PKG_CONFIG})
         unset(ENV{RANLIB})
         unset(ENV{RC})
